      "body": "Hi @absolutejam I'm so sorry for the delay here!\r\n\r\n> First of all - Awesome work on this project! We've begun using it for transparency and had great feedback, so I'd like to pass that straight back to you guys who did the hard work.\r\n\r\nThank you very kindly, I love hearing feedback like this 😁 \r\n\r\nAs you've already mentioned, this would be a big security issue and with GDPR, it's not something I'm keen on implementing as we could never guarantee the use of such option.\r\n\r\nOnce https://github.com/CachetHQ/Cachet/issues/3101 is implemented, you'd actually be able to go into the email views and remove the subscription links. For internal use, this would sit within GDPR, so you'd be okay.\r\n\r\nHope this helps, sorry there's not much you could do short-term.",
